      "label": "OpenApiInfo & OpenApiConfiguration Contract",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Declares info ({ title, version, description? }) so additive top-level fields fit later without breaking the shape; requires title/version and serves absent description as empty rather than a placeholder.",
